# Task Notes

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains standalone task notes. All notes follow the `type: task` schema.

## Frontmatter Schema
```yaml
---
date: YYYY-MM-DD
type: task
tags: [task, ...]
status: in-progress           # in-progress | done | waiting | cancelled
priority: 🔴 | 🟡 | 🟢
due: YYYY-MM-DD
related-projects: ["[[Projects/...]]", ...]
related-people: ["[[People/...]]", ...]
ai-first: true
---
```

## Note Structure
Each task note should contain:
- `## For future Claude` preamble
- `## Description` - What needs to be done
- `## Context` - Why this task exists
- `## Progress` - Current status and next steps
- `## Blockers` - What's preventing completion

## Naming Convention
- Descriptive title, no date prefix
- Example: `Implement Discord IPC Listener.md`
